{
  "registration": {
    "url_path": "dashboard-comfort",
    "title": "Comfort",
    "icon": "mdi:home-thermometer",
    "show_in_sidebar": true,
    "require_admin": false,
    "mode": "storage"
  },
  "config": {
    "title": "Comfort",
    "views": [
      {
        "type": "sections",
        "title": "Comfort",
        "path": "comfort",
        "icon": "mdi:home-thermometer",
        "max_columns": 4,
        "sections": [
          {
            "type": "grid",
            "cards": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "heading": "Comfort control",
                "heading_style": "title",
                "icon": "mdi:home-thermometer"
              },
              {
                "type": "tile",
                "entity": "input_boolean.comfort_control_enable",
                "name": "Comfort control",
                "icon": "mdi:thermostat-auto",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "tap_action": {
                  "action": "toggle"
                },
                "icon_tap_action": {
                  "action": "toggle"
                },
                "hide_state": false
              },
              {
                "type": "tile",
                "entity": "input_boolean.comfort_away",
                "name": "Away (every room at its floor)",
                "icon": "mdi:home-export-outline",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "tap_action": {
                  "action": "toggle"
                },
                "icon_tap_action": {
                  "action": "toggle"
                },
                "hide_state": false
              },
              {
                "type": "tile",
                "entity": "sensor.comfort_control_status",
                "name": "Status",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "state_content": [
                  "state",
                  "phase",
                  "dhw_window"
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "markdown",
                "content": "**Early start** (the day setpoints are written then; one early start for every room):\n\n{% set es = state_attr('sensor.comfort_control_status', 'early_starts') or {} %}{% for day in es | sort %}- {{ day }}: {{ as_local(as_datetime(es[day])).strftime('%H:%M') }}\n{% else %}- not available{% endfor %}\n\n**Manual thermostat changes, last 14 days:** {{ state_attr('sensor.comfort_control_status', 'overrides_14d') | default('-', true) }}",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "grid",
            "cards": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "heading": "Climate optimizer (shadow)",
                "heading_style": "title",
                "icon": "mdi:chart-timeline-variant"
              },
              {
                "type": "tile",
                "entity": "input_select.climate_optimizer_mode",
                "name": "Optimizer mode (off = Rules)",
                "icon": "mdi:robot-outline",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "features": [
                  {
                    "type": "select-options"
                  }
                ],
                "features_position": "bottom"
              },
              {
                "type": "tile",
                "entity": "sensor.comfort_climate_plan_status",
                "name": "Optimizer status",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "state_content": [
                  "status_text"
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "markdown",
                "content": "{% set e = 'sensor.comfort_climate_plan_status' %}{% if state_attr(e, 'requested_mode') is none %}The climate optimizer status is not available yet.{% else %}**Mode:** requested **{{ state_attr(e, 'requested_mode') }}**, effective **{{ state_attr(e, 'effective_mode') }}**.{% if state_attr(e, 'live_locked') %} **Live requested, locked in git: behaving as shadow, nothing is written from the plan.**{% endif %}{% if state_attr(e, 'plan_controls') %} The plan is driving the run decision and the water target.{% endif %}\n\n{% if state_attr(e, 'plan_usable') %}**Plan** {{ state_attr(e, 'plan_id') }}: {{ state_attr(e, 'plan_age_min') }} min old, expires in {{ state_attr(e, 'plan_expires_in_min') }} min.\n\n**Now** (plan vs rules): heating {{ 'on' if state_attr(e, 'plan_heating_now') else 'off' }} vs {{ 'on' if state_attr(e, 'rules_heating_now') else 'off' }}, water {{ state_attr(e, 'plan_water_c_now') | default('-', true) }} vs {{ state_attr(e, 'rules_water_c_now') | default('-', true) }} °C, agree: {{ 'yes' if state_attr(e, 'agree') else 'no' }}.{% if state_attr(e, 'floor_forced') %} A comfort floor overrides the plan in: {{ state_attr(e, 'floor_forced') | join(', ') }}.{% endif %}{% elif state_attr(e, 'requested_mode') == 'off' %}The plan is not read (mode off): the rules decide.{% else %}**No usable plan** ({{ state_attr(e, 'fallback_reason') }}): the rules decide.{% endif %}{% if state_attr(e, 'control_blocked') %} Plan not applied: {{ state_attr(e, 'control_blocked') }}.{% endif %}\n\n**Today:** agreement {{ state_attr(e, 'today_agree_pct') | default('-', true) }} % of {{ state_attr(e, 'today_samples') }} minutes; heating differs {{ state_attr(e, 'today_heating_disagree') }}, water differs {{ state_attr(e, 'today_water_disagree') }}, live would have acted differently {{ state_attr(e, 'today_would_differ') }}; no usable plan {{ state_attr(e, 'today_unusable') }} minutes.{% endif %}",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "markdown",
                "content": "**Live is locked in git** (`optimizer_live_allowed: false` of the comfort controller): choosing *live* behaves exactly like *shadow*. The plan is fetched and compared only; the rules keep driving the heat pump. Comfort floors, the water limits and the compressor minimum on and off times always win over any plan.",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "grid",
            "cards": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "heading": "Hall / Kitchen",
                "heading_style": "title",
                "icon": "mdi:thermometer"
              },
              {
                "type": "thermostat",
                "entity": "climate.thermostat_hall_kitchen",
                "name": "Hall / Kitchen",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "tile",
                "entity": "input_number.comfort_floor_hall_kitchen",
                "name": "Floor (always)",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "features": [
                  {
                    "type": "numeric-input",
                    "style": "slider"
                  }
                ],
                "features_position": "bottom"
              },
              {
                "type": "tile",
                "entity": "input_number.comfort_day_minimum_hall_kitchen",
                "name": "Day minimum (day window)",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "features": [
                  {
                    "type": "numeric-input",
                    "style": "slider"
                  }
                ],
                "features_position": "bottom"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "grid",
            "cards": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "heading": "Bedroom",
                "heading_style": "title",
                "icon": "mdi:thermometer"
              },
              {
                "type": "thermostat",
                "entity": "climate.thermostat_bedroom",
                "name": "Bedroom",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "tile",
                "entity": "input_number.comfort_floor_bedroom",
                "name": "Floor (always)",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "features": [
                  {
                    "type": "numeric-input",
                    "style": "slider"
                  }
                ],
                "features_position": "bottom"
              },
              {
                "type": "tile",
                "entity": "input_number.comfort_day_minimum_bedroom",
                "name": "Day minimum (day window)",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "features": [
                  {
                    "type": "numeric-input",
                    "style": "slider"
                  }
                ],
                "features_position": "bottom"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "grid",
            "cards": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "heading": "Office A",
                "heading_style": "title",
                "icon": "mdi:thermometer"
              },
              {
                "type": "thermostat",
                "entity": "climate.thermostat_office_a",
                "name": "Office A",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "tile",
                "entity": "input_number.comfort_floor_office_a",
                "name": "Floor (always)",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "features": [
                  {
                    "type": "numeric-input",
                    "style": "slider"
                  }
                ],
                "features_position": "bottom"
              },
              {
                "type": "tile",
                "entity": "input_number.comfort_day_minimum_office_a",
                "name": "Day minimum (day window)",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "features": [
                  {
                    "type": "numeric-input",
                    "style": "slider"
                  }
                ],
                "features_position": "bottom"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "grid",
            "cards": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "heading": "Office T",
                "heading_style": "title",
                "icon": "mdi:thermometer"
              },
              {
                "type": "thermostat",
                "entity": "climate.thermostat_office_t",
                "name": "Office T",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "tile",
                "entity": "input_number.comfort_floor_office_t",
                "name": "Floor (always)",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "features": [
                  {
                    "type": "numeric-input",
                    "style": "slider"
                  }
                ],
                "features_position": "bottom"
              },
              {
                "type": "tile",
                "entity": "input_number.comfort_day_minimum_office_t",
                "name": "Day minimum (day window)",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "features": [
                  {
                    "type": "numeric-input",
                    "style": "slider"
                  }
                ],
                "features_position": "bottom"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "grid",
            "cards": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "heading": "Day window and margin (every room)",
                "heading_style": "title",
                "icon": "mdi:clock-outline"
              },
              {
                "type": "entities",
                "show_header_toggle": false,
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "entities": [
                  {
                    "entity": "input_datetime.comfort_weekday_start",
                    "name": "Day window starts (weekdays)"
                  },
                  {
                    "entity": "input_datetime.comfort_weekend_start",
                    "name": "Day window starts (weekends)"
                  },
                  {
                    "entity": "input_datetime.comfort_window_end",
                    "name": "Day window ends"
                  },
                  {
                    "entity": "input_number.comfort_margin",
                    "name": "Margin over the minimum"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "markdown",
                "content": "Setpoints are written **only at boundaries**: the early start (day setpoints) and the window end (night setpoints), plus away on/off and enabling the controller. A change to a slider below, or to a thermostat by hand, holds until the next boundary.\n\nRoom target = floor + margin outside the window, and max(day minimum, floor) + margin inside it. A day minimum below the floor never lowers the floor.",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "grid",
            "cards": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "heading": "Advanced",
                "heading_style": "title",
                "icon": "mdi:cog-outline"
              },
              {
                "type": "custom:expander-card",
                "title": "Advanced settings",
                "expanded": false,
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": 12
                },
                "cards": [
                  {
                    "type": "entities",
                    "show_header_toggle": false,
                    "entities": [
                      {
                        "entity": "input_boolean.comfort_water_dry_run",
                        "name": "Water temperature dry run (on = only logged)"
                      },
                      {
                        "entity": "input_number.comfort_hysteresis",
                        "name": "Heating-on hysteresis"
                      },
                      {
                        "entity": "input_number.comfort_dhw_target",
                        "name": "Hot water tank target (capped at 50 °C)"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "tile",
                    "entity": "input_boolean.comfort_helpers_seeded",
                    "name": "Helpers seeded: turn OFF to reset EVERY helper to its default",
                    "icon": "mdi:restore",
                    "tap_action": {
                      "action": "toggle",
                      "confirmation": {
                        "text": "Turning this off resets every comfort helper to its default (floors, day minimums, window, margin, lead times, curve) and turns the water dry run back on. Continue?"
                      }
                    },
                    "icon_tap_action": {
                      "action": "toggle",
                      "confirmation": {
                        "text": "Turning this off resets every comfort helper to its default and turns the water dry run back on. Continue?"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
